# AICL Example: Reverse Digits
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Reverse decimal

Layer:
Core

Behavior Reverse
    Input: n
    Output: result
    Action:
        result = 0
        while n > 0:
            result = result * 10 + (n % 10)
            n = n // 10
        return result
